```
User Request
      │
      ▼
Conversation
      │
      ▼
Short-Term Memory
      │
      ▼
Context Builder
      │
      ▼
Semantic Retrieval
      │
      ▼
Vector Memory
      │
      ▼
Long-Term Memory
      │
      ▼
Reasoning Engine
      │
      ▼
Response
```

